@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #ffffff

title live-platform 与 LiveKit 的接线关系（本仓库实测配置）

package "live-server (Java)" {
  [LiveKitTokenIssuer] as T
  [RoomService\nstart/stop/republish] as RS
}
package "LiveKit" {
  [livekit\ncompose 服务] as LK
  [ingress\nRTMP 19350 / WHIP 8088] as ING
  database "redis" as R
}
[主播浏览器\nstudio 5173] as A
[观众浏览器\naudience 5174] as V

RS -> T : issuePublisher(房间ID, 主播ID)
RS -> T : issueSubscriber(房间ID, 观众ID+"-sub-"+随机)
T --> A : publisher JWT
T --> V : subscriber JWT（只订阅权限）
A --> LK : /rtc + UDP 7882 推摄像头
V --> LK : 观看
RS -> LK : start 时 deleteRoom 幂等清理
RS -> ING : ensureObsPublish(RTMP|WHIP)
ING --> R : 必须同 redis 才能路由
ING --> LK : 虚拟参与者进房
note bottom of T : 血泪教训①：身份必须唯一\n观众不加后缀会把主播踢断\n血泪教训②：issueSubscriber 的\nLiveKit 身份 ≠ 业务身份\n（业务身份走自有 WS）
note bottom of LK : rtc.node_ip=127.0.0.1\nUDP 7882 / TCP 7881 fallback\nDocker Desktop UDP 端口转发\n可能坏 → 宿主 UDP 不通但 TCP 通
@enduml
